<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8" standalone="yes"?><rss version="2.0" xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom"><channel><title>塔羅牌義 on Lucky Stone</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E7%BE%A9/</link><description>Recent content in 塔羅牌義 on Lucky Stone</description><generator>Hugo</generator><language>zh-TW</language><lastBuildDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://luckystonetw.com/categories/%E5%A1%94%E7%BE%85%E7%89%8C%E7%BE%A9/index.xml" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>錢幣二怎麼讀？行程與資源如何排序</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E8%88%87%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F/</link><pubDate>Mon, 23 Nov 2026 10:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E9%8C%A2%E5%B9%A3%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E8%A1%8C%E7%A8%8B%E8%88%87%E8%B3%87%E6%BA%90%E5%A6%82%E4%BD%95%E6%8E%92%E5%BA%8F/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;同一天要交報告、接孩子、回覆客戶，抽到錢幣二，牌面沒有替你增加時間。它比較像提醒：你正在同時拋接幾件事，得看哪一件先落地。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>聖杯二怎麼讀？把關係期待說清楚</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%8A%8A%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E8%AA%AA%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A/</link><pubDate>Sat, 21 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E8%81%96%E6%9D%AF%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E6%8A%8A%E9%97%9C%E4%BF%82%E6%9C%9F%E5%BE%85%E8%AA%AA%E6%B8%85%E6%A5%9A/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;問一段關係抽到聖杯二，很容易立刻讀成「對方也喜歡我」。牌面可以提醒你留意互動，卻不能證明另一個人心裡想什麼。先問：彼此到底交換了哪些話？&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>寶劍二怎麼讀？卡在兩個選擇時先補資訊</title><link>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E5%8D%A1%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%99%82%E5%85%88%E8%A3%9C%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A/</link><pubDate>Thu, 19 Nov 2026 22:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://luckystonetw.com/post/%E5%AF%B6%E5%8A%8D%E4%BA%8C%E6%80%8E%E9%BA%BC%E8%AE%80%E5%8D%A1%E5%9C%A8%E5%85%A9%E5%80%8B%E9%81%B8%E6%93%87%E6%99%82%E5%85%88%E8%A3%9C%E8%B3%87%E8%A8%8A/</guid><description>&lt;p&gt;兩個選項都擺在眼前，抽到寶劍二，會不會是在叫你「什麼都別做」？在偉特系牌面裡，人物遮住眼睛、雙手交叉持劍；我會先把它讀成資訊與判斷暫時卡住，而不是永久停擺。&lt;a href="https://en.wikisource.org/wiki/The_Pictorial_Key_to_the_Tarot"&gt;Waite 的牌面說明&lt;/a&gt;提供這套圖像傳統的原始脈絡。&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>